<big>Thanks for your support</big>

Packarch is a free and personal project. Every piece of feedback helps to make it better.

<big>Report an issue</big>

If something does not work as expected (a theme, the desktop, a package of the [packarch] repository, the installation), <a href="https://github.com/Antidote1911/CachyOS-Packarch/issues">open an issue on GitHub</a>. Describe what you did, what you expected and what happened: a problem you have is likely to affect other people too.

<big>Suggest an idea</big>

Missing a theme, an application or a setting? Suggest it the same way, on GitHub.

<big>Contribute</big>

All the code of Packarch is on GitHub:

    - <a href="https://github.com/Antidote1911/CachyOS-Packarch">CachyOS-Packarch</a> - the build of the ISO and the installer.
    - <a href="https://github.com/Antidote1911/myrepo-pkgs">myrepo-pkgs</a> - the packages of the [packarch] repository (themes, configuration…).
    - <a href="https://github.com/Antidote1911/packarch-hello">packarch-hello</a> - this welcome window.

Fixes and improvements are welcome, as pull requests.

<big>Support CachyOS</big>

Packarch builds on the work of the CachyOS team: kernels, repositories, tools and the original of this application. You can <a href="https://cachyos.org">support them</a> too.
